    "notes": [
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "CCNL Recapito Corrispondenza (FISE-ARE) signed 14/11/2023 by FISE-ARE, SLC-CGIL, SLP-CISL, UILPOSTE-UIL."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Salary model: split — base_salary = paga tabellare + contingenza combined (rolled); EDR=10.33 as fixed_allowance. GOAL.md CCNL research confirms this structure from ilccnl.it cross-check."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "8 levels (1 highest, 6 lowest): 1, 2, 3S, 3, 4, 5S, 5, 6. 4 tranches: 01/02/2024, 01/09/2024, 01/07/2025, 01/06/2026. Values from redigo.info (14/11/2023 renewal article)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Hourly divisor 173 confirmed from ilccnl.it cross-check (4 levels). Back-calc: 2224.51+10.33=2234.84 / 173 = 12.92 EUR/h for level 1 at Jun 2026."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Additional months: 14 (tredicesima + quattordicesima) confirmed from GOAL.md research."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Seniority: biennale (cadence=24), maximum 8 scatti. Per-level amounts from lavoro-economia.it (c=26), confirmed against kitech at Jun 2026 (L1=36.15, L2=33.05, L3S=32.54, L3=31.50, L4=30.47, L5S=29.70, L5=29.44, L6=28.41)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Levels 1Q (Quadri), Operatore A (1650), Operatore B (1540) exist from Jun 2026 only — no prior tranche history. Not modelled to avoid open-ended periods with single-tranche data."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "SIMPLIFICATION: apprenticeship type and percentages not publicly available from any free source (paywalled). Modelled as apprenticeship: [] with no rules defined."
      }
    ]
  },
